WEBVTT

00:01.610 --> 00:02.947
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.971 --> 00:04.306
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.330 --> 00:07.546
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.570 --> 00:13.130
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.130 --> 01:31.090
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.250 --> 01:34.490
=Episode 23=

01:35.991 --> 01:39.065
(Capital of Liyang Official Posthouse)

01:55.890 --> 01:58.110
News from Qingzhou said

01:59.240 --> 02:01.310
your son was bold enough

02:01.915 --> 02:02.915
to run the risks

02:03.765 --> 02:06.270
for kidnapping Consort of Jing'an.

02:08.615 --> 02:10.290
I heard

02:10.790 --> 02:14.740
Lord of Jing'an
smashed his Buddhist Hall in anger.

02:15.115 --> 02:17.365
He also hired Wang Mingyin,

02:17.490 --> 02:18.966
No. 11 in the world,

02:18.990 --> 02:20.515
to assassinate your son.

02:23.640 --> 02:25.070
I'm impressed

02:25.215 --> 02:27.446
you had Li Chungang

02:27.470 --> 02:28.890
protect him.

02:30.915 --> 02:33.565
Your son threatened Lord of Jing'an
with his consort,

02:33.865 --> 02:36.415
he could do nothing except for
letting him go.

02:37.090 --> 02:38.670
But now,

02:40.040 --> 02:41.390
North Liang will

02:41.690 --> 02:45.090
feud with Qingzhou.

02:46.165 --> 02:48.190
Lots of people hate North Liang,

02:48.940 --> 02:50.540
we can take it
if Zhao Heng does it, too.

02:55.515 --> 02:57.150
Your son

02:58.290 --> 03:00.070
is preposterous.

03:02.015 --> 03:03.630
How do you feel about it?

03:05.065 --> 03:06.590
It doesn't matter what I feel.

03:07.015 --> 03:08.265
It matters what

03:08.440 --> 03:09.870
His Majesty feels.

03:12.065 --> 03:14.515
His Majesty feels pleased.

03:15.390 --> 03:16.390
Well?

03:17.915 --> 03:19.790
In his opinion,

03:19.865 --> 03:21.541
such a preposterous heir

03:21.565 --> 03:23.965
is perfect for North Liang.

03:31.440 --> 03:32.510
Then tell me

03:32.840 --> 03:34.065
when His Majesty

03:34.315 --> 03:35.990
wants to see me?

03:36.365 --> 03:37.365
Be patient.

03:37.390 --> 03:38.565
Wait for several more days.

03:39.340 --> 03:41.886
Your son has left Qingzhou for Yuzhou.

03:41.910 --> 03:44.565
He'll soon arrive at
Jiangnan of Yangzhou.

03:46.365 --> 03:48.070
Fengnian

03:48.390 --> 03:49.430
values family and friends.

03:49.990 --> 03:52.590
He always wants to visit his big sister.

03:54.240 --> 03:55.765
Have you heard the news

03:56.030 --> 03:57.030
from Jiangnan?

03:58.165 --> 03:59.390
Staying in the capital,

03:59.565 --> 04:01.016
my eyes are blindfolded
and my ears are covered.

04:01.040 --> 04:02.315
How can I know anything?

04:08.890 --> 04:10.040
It's said...

04:10.615 --> 04:11.815
It's said that

04:13.690 --> 04:15.865
your eldest daughter

04:16.115 --> 04:17.640
is riotous in Jiangnan.

04:17.910 --> 04:19.310
She has an affair with others.

04:20.630 --> 04:22.616
The Lu Family has filed the suits

04:22.640 --> 04:24.990
to His Majesty.

04:31.440 --> 04:32.750
What a superb move!

04:37.940 --> 04:39.365
Grand Commander,

04:39.515 --> 04:42.240
you didn't notice
the hidden danger of killing.

04:42.515 --> 04:43.715
You'll definitely lose

04:44.215 --> 04:45.790
the game.

04:56.140 --> 04:57.990
It's hopeless.

05:01.165 --> 05:02.190
Do you know

05:03.165 --> 05:05.465
what kind of player
is the most difficult?

05:07.565 --> 05:09.325
Calculate ten steps
before he takes one step.

05:09.640 --> 05:11.440
Seize the initiative
before his opponent does.

05:19.415 --> 05:21.965
The player that messes up the game
is the most difficult.

05:25.890 --> 05:27.530
It doesn't count.
Let's play another game.

05:30.790 --> 05:32.491
It's getting late. I have to go.

05:32.515 --> 05:33.515
You're not going.

05:34.290 --> 05:35.290
Tell you what,

05:35.515 --> 05:37.965
if I don't have
three straight wins today,

05:38.090 --> 05:39.365
you're not going anywhere.

05:39.690 --> 05:40.592
Well...

05:40.616 --> 05:42.430
I've already made the bed for you.

05:42.915 --> 05:44.366
Amitabha.

05:44.390 --> 05:45.490
- Come on.
- I...

05:49.290 --> 05:51.091
- Amitabha.
- Amitabha.

05:51.115 --> 05:52.140
Amitabha.

06:17.990 --> 06:21.142
(Maid Er'qiao)

06:29.515 --> 06:30.515
Lady Zhihu.

06:32.413 --> 06:35.140
(Eldest daughter of Lord of North Liang
Xu Zhihu)

06:43.140 --> 06:44.140
What are you doing?

06:45.415 --> 06:47.335
The Lu Family has a clean
and upright reputation,

06:47.390 --> 06:48.287
not expecting it to be ruined

06:48.311 --> 06:50.590
by such a loose woman like you.

06:50.715 --> 06:51.715
Xu Zhihu,

06:52.415 --> 06:54.040
rumors of you seducing men

06:54.340 --> 06:55.806
have spread around the whole city.

06:55.830 --> 06:57.350
You're indeed shameless.

06:58.240 --> 06:59.240
Do you envy me?

06:59.615 --> 07:00.615
You...

07:01.790 --> 07:03.470
You shameless slut.

07:04.765 --> 07:06.065
You pathetic thing.

07:06.765 --> 07:08.740
No man wants you

07:08.890 --> 07:10.090
even if you want to be a slut.

07:10.190 --> 07:11.406
I must rip your mouth off.

07:11.430 --> 07:12.430
How dare you!

07:12.490 --> 07:13.726
Let go.

07:13.750 --> 07:14.750
Er'qiao.

07:14.865 --> 07:15.646
Step aside.

07:15.670 --> 07:16.670
Let go of me.

07:17.115 --> 07:18.990
Didn't you want to rip my mouth off?

07:20.015 --> 07:21.015
Help yourself.

07:21.440 --> 07:23.040
You don't think I dare to do so, do you?

07:23.690 --> 07:25.070
I bet you dare not.

07:28.940 --> 07:30.315
Will you do it or not?

07:31.140 --> 07:32.765
I have a book to read.

07:35.140 --> 07:36.890
It's a tragedy
to have such a woman like you

07:36.990 --> 07:38.915
marry into the family.

07:43.890 --> 07:44.890
Lady Zhihu,

07:45.165 --> 07:47.230
the Lu Family is going too far.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.290
Why do you still smile?

07:53.715 --> 07:55.265
Of course I'm smiling.

07:55.890 --> 07:57.670
I'm in a very good mood today.

07:59.015 --> 08:00.550
My brother is coming to see me.

08:01.290 --> 08:02.470
By my reckoning,

08:02.915 --> 08:04.630
it takes Fengnian two more days

08:05.090 --> 08:07.440
to arrive at Yangcheng.

08:17.765 --> 08:19.941
(Yangcheng)

08:19.965 --> 08:21.541
(Yangzhou Yangcheng)

08:21.565 --> 08:22.565
Here we are.

08:23.315 --> 08:24.326
Ask for directions to the Lu Family

08:24.350 --> 08:25.350
after we get in.

08:26.490 --> 08:27.490
Your Highness.

08:27.640 --> 08:29.291
Should we wait for others
to catch up with us?

08:29.315 --> 08:30.566
I'm going to visit my sister first.

08:30.590 --> 08:31.886
They can meet when they arrive.

08:31.910 --> 08:32.910
Your Highness.

08:35.365 --> 08:36.365
What's up?

08:37.190 --> 08:38.550
Mr. Li said he was hungry.

08:39.765 --> 08:40.540
Sure.

08:40.715 --> 08:42.006
It was a long journey.

08:42.030 --> 08:43.090
We've had a long day.

08:43.815 --> 08:44.767
No hurry.

08:44.791 --> 08:45.846
Let's find a restaurant

08:45.870 --> 08:47.340
and have a square meal

08:47.765 --> 08:48.965
before we visit the Lu Family.

08:49.140 --> 08:49.767
OK.

08:49.791 --> 08:52.840
(Yangcheng)

08:54.515 --> 08:56.766
(Yiding Restaurant)

08:56.790 --> 08:57.492
Your Highness.

08:57.516 --> 08:58.966
I've sent my men to pick up Mr. Li.

08:58.990 --> 08:59.990
They'll arrive later.

09:00.090 --> 09:01.090
Let's eat first.

09:01.515 --> 09:02.515
All right.

09:10.390 --> 09:11.242
Let's order.

09:11.266 --> 09:12.291
Then we'll ask for directions.

09:12.315 --> 09:13.315
Yeah. OK.

09:15.565 --> 09:16.616
Hey, guys.

09:16.640 --> 09:17.640
I heard

09:17.765 --> 09:18.886
the son of Lord of North Liang

09:18.910 --> 09:20.016
is coming to Yangcheng

09:20.040 --> 09:21.350
to visit his elder sister.

09:21.440 --> 09:23.486
The brother is ignorant

09:23.510 --> 09:25.390
while the sister is shameless.

09:25.515 --> 09:26.766
They are

09:26.790 --> 09:28.115
the same kind of people.

09:28.240 --> 09:29.290
I heard

09:29.465 --> 09:31.526
Mr. Chengzhai's wife

09:31.550 --> 09:33.666
called Xu Zhihu

09:33.690 --> 09:35.315
a whore.

09:36.465 --> 09:37.726
The rumors

09:37.750 --> 09:39.415
have reached the capital.

09:40.315 --> 09:41.790
You know what,

09:42.040 --> 09:43.750
a concubine in the palace

09:43.865 --> 09:46.765
is of the same clan
as Mr. Chengzhai's wife.

09:47.215 --> 09:48.341
According to the family hierarchy,

09:48.365 --> 09:50.515
Mr. Chengzhai's wife
is one of her nieces.

09:51.115 --> 09:52.866
Xu Zhihu is such a dissolute woman.

09:52.890 --> 09:54.265
How could the Lu Family

09:54.390 --> 09:55.815
face other people?

10:04.465 --> 10:05.665
Tell me about

10:07.015 --> 10:08.615
the Lu Family.

10:12.690 --> 10:14.390
I was just thinking

10:14.815 --> 10:16.270
Xu Xiao is the kind of man

10:16.715 --> 10:19.140
who calculates ten steps
before he takes one.

10:19.390 --> 10:20.646
Why did he allow us

10:20.670 --> 10:22.150
to follow Xu Fengnian?

10:22.615 --> 10:23.726
I'm always afraid that

10:23.750 --> 10:26.430
we'll become victims of his tricks.

10:26.940 --> 10:28.840
Being afraid won't do you any good.

10:29.090 --> 10:30.790
Let's wait and see first.

10:31.865 --> 10:32.865
By the way,

10:33.065 --> 10:34.966
why don't you take the carriage

10:34.990 --> 10:36.230
in front of us today?

10:56.740 --> 10:58.866
God of Sword snores heavily?

10:58.890 --> 10:59.890
It's too noisy.

11:01.990 --> 11:03.230
I don't understand.

11:03.565 --> 11:05.141
The two little fellas

11:05.165 --> 11:06.991
always jump about around me.

11:07.015 --> 11:08.340
They seem to fear nothing.

11:09.190 --> 11:11.070
Why are they as good and quiet

11:11.115 --> 11:12.965
as kittens when they're around Mr. Li?

11:13.590 --> 11:15.116
The old man is highly skilled
in martial arts.

11:15.140 --> 11:16.465
He can keep them under control.

11:17.365 --> 11:18.470
That is to say,

11:18.590 --> 11:20.950
it's useful
to be skilled in martial arts.

11:22.740 --> 11:24.806
With numerous martial artists,

11:24.830 --> 11:26.590
West Chu was still destroyed.

11:26.815 --> 11:28.815
That was because North Liang
was too strong.

11:29.540 --> 11:30.740
We had the upper hand

11:30.890 --> 11:33.230
at the beginning of the war.

11:33.340 --> 11:34.247
I heard

11:34.271 --> 11:36.090
many generals of Liyang were killed.

11:36.940 --> 11:37.940
Yeah.

11:38.115 --> 11:41.565
The legitimate son of the Lu Family
was captured

11:41.715 --> 11:43.290
and was put to death by my father.

11:43.540 --> 11:44.550
Which family?

11:46.990 --> 11:48.470
The Lu Family in Yangcheng,

11:48.590 --> 11:50.065
Xu Zhihu's husband's family?

11:52.315 --> 11:54.440
They must bear a deep grudge
against you.

11:54.690 --> 11:56.340
They don't know my identity.

11:56.465 --> 11:57.465
Don't worry.

12:09.290 --> 12:09.990
Sir.

12:10.290 --> 12:10.940
Yeah.

12:11.240 --> 12:12.390
What's up?

12:12.665 --> 12:13.666
Have we got to the restaurant?

12:13.690 --> 12:14.690
Mansion of Lu is not far.

12:14.765 --> 12:16.040
Would you like to eat there?

12:16.290 --> 12:17.141
It's fine.

12:17.165 --> 12:18.165
Call me when we arrive.

12:18.615 --> 12:19.910
Please take care of everyone

12:20.015 --> 12:21.765
when you're at the mansion.

12:22.165 --> 12:23.165
And

12:25.015 --> 12:26.950
don't expose Jiang Ni's identity
to the family.

12:31.390 --> 12:32.550
Don't you come with us?

12:33.115 --> 12:34.341
I'm going to Jiangxin County

12:34.365 --> 12:35.590
to meet someone surnamed Liu.

12:37.365 --> 12:38.405
Are you going to kill him?

12:39.290 --> 12:40.430
I'm going to figure out

12:40.665 --> 12:42.310
what's his relationship with my sister.

12:42.865 --> 12:44.990
Don't you know the relationship

12:45.365 --> 12:46.630
between Mr. Liu and Xu Zhihu?

12:47.015 --> 12:48.390
Do they have an affair?

12:48.890 --> 12:51.015
What kind of person is Liu?

12:51.215 --> 12:52.446
He has literary talent

12:52.470 --> 12:54.270
and profound learning
inherited by his family.

12:54.415 --> 12:55.390
The slut ran into him

12:55.415 --> 12:57.846
at Baoguo Temple

12:57.870 --> 13:00.590
and shamelessly seduced him.

13:00.965 --> 13:02.991
He was contemptuous of her.

13:03.015 --> 13:04.591
(Gentry of Jiangnan Liu Liting)
He simply ignored her.

13:04.615 --> 13:06.070
Coincidentally,

13:06.415 --> 13:09.291
(Liu Liting's wife)
Mr. Liu's wife came upon them.

13:09.315 --> 13:11.390
Liu's wife is well connected.

13:11.765 --> 13:14.790
It's said she is related
to a concubine in the palace.

13:15.665 --> 13:17.606
She is Her Grace's niece.

13:17.630 --> 13:19.070
You don't say.

13:19.240 --> 13:21.070
How can she put up with such a slut?

13:21.165 --> 13:22.590
Do you know what she did?

13:24.015 --> 13:26.910
She slapped her directly in the face.

13:27.190 --> 13:28.865
She worked off her anger.

13:29.890 --> 13:32.166
Now everyone in Yangcheng knows

13:32.190 --> 13:34.215
our family
have such a daughter-in-law.

13:34.540 --> 13:35.710
It isn't true.

13:35.890 --> 13:37.390
It was not the case.

13:38.240 --> 13:39.766
Do you try to deny it for her?

13:39.790 --> 13:40.447
Let's go.

13:40.471 --> 13:42.031
People have a sense of natural justice.

13:51.740 --> 13:52.740
Never mind.

13:54.815 --> 13:56.865
It's natural that

13:57.150 --> 13:59.030
being wronged and misunderstood
makes you sad.

14:00.015 --> 14:01.390
But remember,

14:02.940 --> 14:04.215
don't cry over it.

14:07.665 --> 14:08.915
Tears should only

14:09.265 --> 14:11.415
(Elegant and Refined)
be shed for your loved ones.

14:11.690 --> 14:12.690
Remember?

14:12.890 --> 14:13.890
Yes.

14:21.165 --> 14:23.165
(Yangcheng of Yangzhou
Mansion of Lu)

14:31.115 --> 14:32.391
Son of Lord of North Liang,

14:32.415 --> 14:33.415
Xu Fengnian,

14:33.540 --> 14:34.670
drove by Yangcheng.

14:35.090 --> 14:36.090
Please...

14:43.265 --> 14:44.140
I've inquired about it.

14:44.265 --> 14:45.830
It's Liu Liting's mansion.

14:46.215 --> 14:47.340
How's his reputation?

14:47.615 --> 14:49.165
People say he writes good articles.

14:49.265 --> 14:50.366
He's been talented since he was a child.

14:50.390 --> 14:51.390
What about his family?

14:52.615 --> 14:54.266
In Yangzhou,

14:54.290 --> 14:56.840
his family is only regarded as
second-class.

15:00.340 --> 15:01.565
That doesn't feel right.

15:01.740 --> 15:02.740
What do you mean?

15:03.015 --> 15:05.126
The Lu Family is a first-class family.

15:05.150 --> 15:06.007
Lu Daolin, the head of the Lu Family,

15:06.031 --> 15:07.116
is the Minister of Rites

15:07.140 --> 15:08.966
and the principal
of the national college.

15:08.990 --> 15:09.870
With such a status,

15:09.910 --> 15:11.206
even Zhang Julu has to

15:11.230 --> 15:12.630
show some respect for him.

15:12.715 --> 15:14.366
How dare Liu Liting

15:14.390 --> 15:16.350
hook up with the daughter-in-law
of the Lu Family?

15:20.115 --> 15:21.115
Your Highness.

15:21.665 --> 15:23.415
The whole city knows

15:23.740 --> 15:25.390
it's Lady Zhihu
who has crushes on Liu.

15:25.690 --> 15:27.440
Liu didn't hook up with her.

15:30.465 --> 15:32.041
With my sister's status,

15:32.065 --> 15:33.765
how can she
have crushes on such a man?

15:35.990 --> 15:37.526
Love is not

15:37.550 --> 15:38.686
reasonable.

15:38.710 --> 15:39.710
Enough.

15:40.015 --> 15:41.670
Let's find out the truth.

15:42.040 --> 15:43.040
Shu Xiu.

15:44.190 --> 15:45.265
I'm counting on you.

16:05.640 --> 16:07.915
(Mansion of Lu)

16:21.540 --> 16:22.890
Who are you?

16:23.915 --> 16:25.440
I'm Lu Dongyang,

16:25.640 --> 16:27.165
housekeeper of the mansion.

16:28.240 --> 16:29.310
Nice to meet you.

16:29.690 --> 16:31.446
Xu Fengnian,
son of Lord of North Liang,

16:31.470 --> 16:32.470
drove by your city.

16:32.715 --> 16:34.030
We come to visit relatives.

16:35.690 --> 16:37.065
(No Guests) What a coincidence.

16:40.046 --> 16:42.341
(No Guests)

16:42.365 --> 16:44.215
We don't receive guests today.

16:44.865 --> 16:46.030
Please go back.

16:46.340 --> 16:47.390
Pay a visit another day.

16:47.790 --> 16:48.790
Well,

16:48.915 --> 16:49.566
we've just

16:49.590 --> 16:50.590
arrived at Yangcheng.

16:50.740 --> 16:51.740
We have no place to stay.

16:52.015 --> 16:53.490
It's none of my business.

16:56.315 --> 16:59.310
Would you please do us a favor
and inform Lady Zhihu?

16:59.740 --> 17:01.765
Xu Zhihu ruined the family tradition.

17:01.990 --> 17:03.950
How does she have the face
to receive guests?

17:11.440 --> 17:12.440
Mr. Lu,

17:13.990 --> 17:15.840
whatever the truth is,

17:20.290 --> 17:22.865
please announce

17:23.065 --> 17:24.590
our arrival.

17:29.990 --> 17:30.887
What're you doing?

17:30.911 --> 17:32.790
The guy humiliated us on purpose.

17:33.115 --> 17:34.710
It has nothing to do with you.

17:34.830 --> 17:36.415
I can't bear it.

17:36.765 --> 17:37.765
Oh, dear.

17:38.540 --> 17:40.391
Have you forgotten the grudge
the Lu Family held against your country?

17:40.415 --> 17:41.446
How dare you get out?

17:41.470 --> 17:43.070
Aren't you afraid they'll recognize you?

17:43.515 --> 17:44.966
I was young at that time.

17:44.990 --> 17:45.990
They won't recognize me.

17:46.340 --> 17:48.470
It's said North Liang is a wild land.

17:48.715 --> 17:50.310
You really know nothing about courtesy.

17:50.665 --> 17:52.630
Didn't I make it clear?

17:53.540 --> 17:54.910
We don't receive guests today.

17:55.065 --> 17:56.470
Why should I notice your arrival?

17:58.065 --> 17:59.726
Wei Shuyang is such a coward.

17:59.750 --> 18:01.030
How could he swallow the insult?

18:02.615 --> 18:04.666
Since Xu's daughter
married into Lu Family,

18:04.690 --> 18:06.190
they've become allies.

18:06.865 --> 18:09.070
Considering the relationship
between the two families,

18:09.390 --> 18:10.630
Wei Shuyang won't be reckless.

18:13.315 --> 18:14.740
Ouch.

18:15.865 --> 18:16.865
Give me a blade.

18:20.290 --> 18:21.686
How dare you!

18:21.710 --> 18:22.490
Don't be reckless.

18:22.640 --> 18:23.640
This...

18:24.940 --> 18:26.190
This is Yangcheng,

18:26.365 --> 18:27.926
not North Liang.

18:27.950 --> 18:29.246
In North Liang,
we have a simple rule

18:29.270 --> 18:30.830
to treat people.

18:31.690 --> 18:32.890
If you treat me with courtesy,

18:33.040 --> 18:34.240
I'll return you with courtesy.

18:34.640 --> 18:35.915
If you treat me with blades,

18:36.390 --> 18:37.486
I'll return you with those, too.

18:37.510 --> 18:39.016
(No Guests)

18:39.040 --> 18:40.265
Mr. Lu, please forgive her.

18:46.490 --> 18:47.515
Open the door.

18:48.415 --> 18:49.566
Hurry up.

18:49.590 --> 18:51.526
Open the side door and let them in.

18:51.550 --> 18:52.690
Open the front door.

18:53.290 --> 18:54.415
To open the front door

18:54.940 --> 18:56.950
requires the head's permission.

18:58.940 --> 19:01.070
I can't make the decision.

19:01.240 --> 19:02.515
Do you mind if I

19:02.840 --> 19:04.030
go to ask for permission?

19:04.915 --> 19:05.990
Don't bother.

19:06.840 --> 19:08.136
Remove the front door.

19:08.160 --> 19:09.160
Ah?

19:11.115 --> 19:12.115
Give it to me.

19:15.090 --> 19:16.310
Don't follow me.

19:16.515 --> 19:17.515
Get back to your work.

19:22.290 --> 19:23.750
He is Liu Liting.

19:24.115 --> 19:25.326
Other scholars

19:25.350 --> 19:27.190
usually keep away from the kitchen,

19:27.340 --> 19:28.846
but he would cook himself.

19:28.870 --> 19:29.950
It's rare.

19:30.090 --> 19:31.090
Honey.

19:31.165 --> 19:32.165
It's me.

19:32.890 --> 19:34.640
My sister won't have crushes on him.

19:36.190 --> 19:37.590
Why are you so sure?

19:38.265 --> 19:39.590
She's got someone in her mind.

19:42.115 --> 19:43.635
Is it her husband who died of illness?

19:44.515 --> 19:45.870
He is at

19:45.990 --> 19:47.110
Mount Wudang.

19:48.090 --> 19:49.590
Mount Wudang?

19:49.990 --> 19:51.465
Aren't there all Taoists?

19:52.190 --> 19:53.230
Get back to your work.

20:04.515 --> 20:05.726
Here, honey.

20:05.750 --> 20:07.086
Try this soup.

20:07.110 --> 20:08.590
I've cooked it for a long time.

20:09.415 --> 20:10.640
Are you still angry?

20:11.015 --> 20:12.646
It's bad for your health.

20:12.670 --> 20:13.926
I'd better die of anger.

20:13.950 --> 20:15.510
You'll find it satisfactory, won't you?

20:16.965 --> 20:18.590
You're wrong about me.

20:18.715 --> 20:19.527
You know

20:19.551 --> 20:21.715
it was the slut who pestered me.

20:23.215 --> 20:25.215
It was an unexpected calamity.

20:27.815 --> 20:29.790
The woman is much younger than me.

20:32.840 --> 20:33.840
Honey.

20:34.090 --> 20:36.315
I love you truly.

20:36.890 --> 20:38.670
How could I be attracted to that slut?

20:39.365 --> 20:42.350
Why don't you believe me?

20:44.190 --> 20:45.990
That woman is shameless.

20:46.115 --> 20:47.731
Don't see her again.

20:47.755 --> 20:48.791
I won't.

20:48.815 --> 20:49.916
I avoid her like the plague.

20:49.940 --> 20:51.065
How would I see her?

20:51.890 --> 20:52.890
Taste this.

20:53.615 --> 20:54.615
Don't be angry.

20:55.840 --> 20:57.150
Madam hasn't started eating yet.

20:57.290 --> 20:58.710
Come when she finishes off.

21:01.790 --> 21:03.616
The servants become unruly now.

21:03.640 --> 21:04.740
Don't be upset.

21:05.340 --> 21:06.340
I'll have a look.

21:08.865 --> 21:09.865
Who is it?

21:10.865 --> 21:12.310
Liu Liting, Mr. Liu.

21:13.465 --> 21:14.591
Who is this?

21:14.615 --> 21:16.065
How dare she come to our home?

21:16.415 --> 21:17.715
I don't know her, either.

21:19.065 --> 21:20.310
How did you get in?

21:21.365 --> 21:22.365
What do you want?

21:25.665 --> 21:26.665
It tastes good.

21:27.315 --> 21:28.430
Liu Liting.

21:28.515 --> 21:29.806
What's going on exactly?

21:29.830 --> 21:30.691
Honey.

21:30.715 --> 21:31.567
Honey, cool down.

21:31.591 --> 21:34.015
I really don't know who she is.

21:35.390 --> 21:36.646
Who are you exactly?

21:36.670 --> 21:37.910
How did you get in our mansion?

21:38.065 --> 21:39.065
Get out...

21:40.315 --> 21:41.590
Honey.

21:42.110 --> 21:43.216
Cool down. Don't be angry.

21:43.240 --> 21:44.047
Don't be angry.

21:44.071 --> 21:45.326
Get someone to take her
and send her to the government.

21:45.350 --> 21:46.870
Yes. I'm going to get help.

21:47.315 --> 21:48.666
Madam, your hairpin is beautiful.

21:48.690 --> 21:49.765
What do you want?

21:50.440 --> 21:51.440
Ouch.

21:53.240 --> 21:54.866
Miss, if you want money,

21:54.890 --> 21:56.086
let him go.

21:56.110 --> 21:57.047
We can talk about it.

21:57.071 --> 21:58.150
I don't want money.

21:58.465 --> 21:59.407
I want a life.

21:59.431 --> 22:01.430
Mr. Liu is of a great name.

22:01.765 --> 22:03.110
Why don't you lend me your life?

22:04.365 --> 22:06.440
We've never met each other before.

22:06.965 --> 22:08.230
Why do you hate me so much?

22:08.415 --> 22:09.750
I don't hate you,

22:10.190 --> 22:11.510
but I hate North Liang

22:11.940 --> 22:13.230
very much.

22:13.440 --> 22:15.441
I have nothing to do with North Liang.

22:15.465 --> 22:16.590
Xu Zhihu

22:16.910 --> 22:18.341
is Xu Xiao's daughter.

22:18.365 --> 22:21.150
Then you should go to Mansion of Lu
and kill her.

22:21.940 --> 22:23.486
The mansion is heavily guarded.

22:23.510 --> 22:24.167
Besides,

22:24.191 --> 22:25.326
Lu Baijie, Sword Immortal of Tangxi,

22:25.350 --> 22:27.066
is also in the mansion.

22:27.090 --> 22:28.086
I can't break in.

22:28.110 --> 22:30.086
(Mansion of Lu)

22:30.110 --> 22:31.565
It's much brighter.

22:33.915 --> 22:35.550
Don't you think you've gone too far?

22:37.240 --> 22:40.120
The more domineering we are,
the more relieved the royal court will feel.

22:41.315 --> 22:42.590
If we're disciplined,

22:43.290 --> 22:44.470
they'll fear us instead.

22:53.415 --> 22:55.510
After all, we represent His Highness.

22:55.665 --> 22:56.910
You shouldn't humiliate us.

23:01.415 --> 23:02.415
Let's get inside.

23:03.315 --> 23:04.390
Today,

23:04.790 --> 23:06.910
it was our fault to shut you out.

23:09.615 --> 23:10.790
I apologize

23:10.915 --> 23:11.915
to you

23:12.390 --> 23:13.550
on behalf of the housekeeper.

23:15.840 --> 23:16.990
Baxiu Sword.

23:17.065 --> 23:18.110
You are...

23:19.615 --> 23:21.110
You're Sword Immortal of Tangxi,

23:21.790 --> 23:22.692
Lu Baijie.

23:22.716 --> 23:24.466
(Sword Immortal of Tangxi
Lu Baijie)

23:24.490 --> 23:25.865
In the presence of God of Sword,

23:26.915 --> 23:28.350
I feel unworthy of the name.

23:29.315 --> 23:31.430
I've heard the name of God of Sword
for a long time.

23:31.715 --> 23:32.866
Today, I venture to suggest you

23:32.890 --> 23:34.790
show me Snakes in Sleeves.

23:35.265 --> 23:36.785
Let's have a competition on swordplay.

23:37.315 --> 23:38.910
How do you know he is with us?

23:39.640 --> 23:40.960
Since the battle of Reed Marshes,

23:41.440 --> 23:42.941
God of Sword's valorous fame

23:42.965 --> 23:44.510
has spread throughout the world.

23:46.115 --> 23:47.115
Sir,

23:47.590 --> 23:49.090
would you condescend to teach me?

24:01.390 --> 24:02.390
Qingniao.

24:02.790 --> 24:03.790
Lady Zhihu.

24:05.165 --> 24:06.067
Grandpa Wei.

24:06.091 --> 24:07.265
Lady Zhihu.

24:07.565 --> 24:08.815
You came so soon.

24:10.240 --> 24:11.240
Where's Fengnian?

24:11.815 --> 24:13.335
He went to Jiangxin County.

24:16.390 --> 24:17.790
He's such a fool.

24:21.190 --> 24:22.230
Uncle.

24:22.940 --> 24:24.070
What're you doing?

24:26.715 --> 24:27.835
Being apart for a long time,

24:28.340 --> 24:29.470
you should catch up first.

24:31.940 --> 24:32.940
I got it.

24:33.290 --> 24:35.416
Lu Baijie is the only one

24:35.440 --> 24:36.526
who regards Xu Zhihu

24:36.550 --> 24:37.990
as a family member in the Lu Family.

24:38.440 --> 24:39.865
It's not easy for you

24:40.040 --> 24:41.040
to kill Xu Zhihu.

24:41.590 --> 24:42.590
But, Miss,

24:42.640 --> 24:44.046
you want to kill
a member of the Xu Family,

24:44.070 --> 24:45.366
yet I'm from the Liu Family.

24:45.390 --> 24:46.910
Everyone in Jiangnan knows that

24:47.690 --> 24:50.150
you and Xu Zhihu are having an affair.

24:50.510 --> 24:51.590
By killing you,

24:51.940 --> 24:53.770
I'll let her know the taste of pain.

24:53.940 --> 24:54.940
Miss.

24:55.590 --> 24:56.590
Miss.

24:56.840 --> 24:58.866
Though the slut pestered my husband,

24:58.890 --> 25:00.790
he despised her very much.

25:00.830 --> 25:02.190
They don't have an affair.

25:03.065 --> 25:04.190
Why don't you escape?

25:05.165 --> 25:07.041
A wife and her husband
should live or die together.

25:07.065 --> 25:08.865
How can I leave him?

25:09.115 --> 25:10.341
Ouch.

25:10.365 --> 25:12.340
You have such a good wife.

25:12.790 --> 25:14.310
All she said is true.

25:15.040 --> 25:17.550
I have nothing to do with Xu Zhihu.

25:17.715 --> 25:19.550
I'm disgusted with her.

25:20.940 --> 25:22.406
It doesn't matter
how you feel about her.

25:22.430 --> 25:23.590
The point is she loves you.

25:23.940 --> 25:25.070
Killing you

25:25.265 --> 25:26.510
will make her feel pain.

25:27.090 --> 25:28.206
Miss, spare my life.

25:28.230 --> 25:29.286
Miss, have mercy on me.

25:29.310 --> 25:29.892
Shut up.

25:29.916 --> 25:31.310
Honey, help me.

25:31.540 --> 25:32.540
Miss,

25:33.240 --> 25:35.510
I'm related to a concubine
in the palace.

25:36.215 --> 25:37.326
Have you thought about

25:37.350 --> 25:38.630
the consequences?

25:39.015 --> 25:40.230
People don't think much

25:41.340 --> 25:42.486
while seeking revenge.

25:42.510 --> 25:43.686
Wait. Wait.

25:43.710 --> 25:44.287
Miss.

25:44.311 --> 25:46.310
Let me help you to kill Xu Zhihu.

25:46.990 --> 25:48.290
How can you do that?

25:49.715 --> 25:51.990
The slut still has a fantasy about me.

25:52.365 --> 25:53.491
If I ask her out,

25:53.515 --> 25:54.526
she'll definitely come out.

25:54.550 --> 25:55.910
Why do you tread in muddy water?

25:56.815 --> 25:58.166
Let me write a letter

25:58.190 --> 25:59.710
and ask her out.

25:59.965 --> 26:00.965
Look at me.

26:01.315 --> 26:02.910
I'm so weak.

26:03.265 --> 26:04.710
How can I escape?

26:08.340 --> 26:09.340
It's right.

26:09.615 --> 26:10.615
Ouch.

26:11.865 --> 26:12.865
Ouch.

26:17.365 --> 26:18.790
Try to run away

26:18.990 --> 26:20.270
or scream for help.

26:20.815 --> 26:22.670
I don't think anyone would come
to rescue you.

26:22.840 --> 26:23.965
I dare not.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.840
Let me find a brush and some ink.

26:51.630 --> 26:52.950
The words I'm about to say

26:54.115 --> 26:55.470
mustn't be heard by her.

26:57.040 --> 26:58.040
What words?

26:58.115 --> 26:59.750
The real relationship

26:59.965 --> 27:01.230
between Xu Zhihu and me.

27:01.490 --> 27:05.790
(Cries of Crane)

27:12.815 --> 27:13.915
Thank you.

27:14.615 --> 27:15.790
Don't stand on ceremony.

27:16.165 --> 27:18.141
I'm glad to see the people

27:18.165 --> 27:19.630
from North Liang.

27:19.890 --> 27:20.890
Sit down.

27:24.540 --> 27:26.641
I've arranged accommodation
for everyone.

27:26.665 --> 27:27.990
Don't worry.

27:30.165 --> 27:31.670
Fengnian

27:32.290 --> 27:34.115
should come to see me first.

27:34.465 --> 27:35.417
His Highness

27:35.441 --> 27:36.950
heard the rumors.

27:37.065 --> 27:38.640
He wanted to find out the truth.

27:42.265 --> 27:44.006
What happened between me and Liu Liting

27:44.030 --> 27:46.115
wasn't like what people made out.

27:46.965 --> 27:47.965
How come?

27:48.765 --> 27:50.405
It was you who pestered Xu Zhihu?

27:50.515 --> 27:51.630
Yes, I did.

27:53.240 --> 27:54.890
Every time when Xu came out,

27:55.140 --> 27:56.790
I would find a chance to run into her.

27:57.290 --> 27:58.190
I wrote her poets

27:58.290 --> 27:59.410
and complimented her beauty.

27:59.915 --> 28:01.340
I used a variety of tactics

28:01.440 --> 28:03.110
and exhausted all mental efforts.

28:03.740 --> 28:05.265
If it were another woman,

28:05.715 --> 28:06.830
she would be moved.

28:07.315 --> 28:09.750
But Xu Zhihu was iron-hearted.

28:10.040 --> 28:11.870
She always kept a good distance from me.

28:13.040 --> 28:14.270
What about Baoguo Temple?

28:21.515 --> 28:22.915
That mild-mannered girl

28:23.315 --> 28:24.630
is a good mate to a gentleman.

28:25.065 --> 28:26.190
I am

28:26.390 --> 28:27.640
mad about you.

28:34.465 --> 28:36.150
Your wife happened to see you?

28:38.615 --> 28:39.815
It wasn't a coincidence.

28:40.940 --> 28:42.550
She specially went to look for me.

28:44.690 --> 28:45.690
And then?

28:46.190 --> 28:47.830
She didn't see me catching her sleeves.

28:48.590 --> 28:49.865
I kept my wits about me

28:50.015 --> 28:51.926
and scolded Xu Zhihu
for being lack of virtue

28:51.950 --> 28:53.270
and pestering me again and again.

28:53.615 --> 28:54.990
You were pretty quick.

28:55.315 --> 28:56.950
I was out of option.

28:57.590 --> 28:58.590
What happened next?

29:01.015 --> 29:02.430
My wife believed me.

29:02.715 --> 29:04.430
She slapped Xu in anger.

29:12.765 --> 29:14.230
How dare you strike me back?

29:14.465 --> 29:16.630
You treat me with blades,
I'll return you with blades.

29:17.215 --> 29:19.190
It's what the people of North Liang do.

29:22.865 --> 29:23.910
So,

29:24.215 --> 29:25.710
Xu Zhihu doesn't

29:25.990 --> 29:27.090
have any affection for me.

29:27.240 --> 29:29.320
The only thing she has towards me
is probably hatred.

29:30.065 --> 29:31.065
Miss,

29:31.265 --> 29:32.470
it won't hurt her at all

29:32.890 --> 29:34.190
if you kill me.

29:36.065 --> 29:37.165
I don't understand.

29:37.940 --> 29:39.670
Since Xu was pestered by you,

29:39.715 --> 29:41.390
why didn't she clarify the rumors?

29:41.815 --> 29:42.815
Well,

29:42.950 --> 29:44.515
I didn't figure it out myself.

29:45.615 --> 29:46.670
Perhaps...

29:47.870 --> 29:48.940
Perhaps she was

29:49.165 --> 29:50.415
too proud

29:50.590 --> 29:52.140
to clarify it?

29:53.515 --> 29:55.790
Liu Liting has a literary fame

29:55.890 --> 29:56.910
while I am

29:57.190 --> 29:58.390
from North Liang.

29:58.940 --> 30:01.006
People in Jiangnan

30:01.030 --> 30:02.350
regard us as monsters.

30:02.790 --> 30:04.950
Do you think anyone will believe me?

30:05.440 --> 30:06.470
What about the Lu Family?

30:06.840 --> 30:08.286
You've married into the family.

30:08.310 --> 30:09.830
They should treat you differently.

30:11.465 --> 30:12.915
The so-called marriage

30:13.165 --> 30:14.240
was just a deal

30:14.270 --> 30:15.790
made by the Lu Family and North Liang.

30:16.190 --> 30:17.550
As soon as the deal is done,

30:17.965 --> 30:19.590
I'm of no use.

30:20.165 --> 30:21.646
Why do you think they let me

30:21.670 --> 30:23.190
marry a dying man?

30:26.340 --> 30:27.340
Lady Zhihu,

30:27.665 --> 30:28.686
I'm sorry you are wronged.

30:28.710 --> 30:29.750
Don't be.

30:30.315 --> 30:31.940
I'm willing to do so.

30:32.490 --> 30:34.840
It's good enough that
North Liang sacrificed me

30:35.140 --> 30:36.470
in exchange for an ally.

30:36.840 --> 30:37.990
I mean

30:38.390 --> 30:40.110
the rumors about you and Liu Liting.

30:41.340 --> 30:43.046
A bunch of people I don't know
defame me.

30:43.070 --> 30:44.290
It has nothing to do with me.

30:44.940 --> 30:46.840
I don't feel like
arguing with them at all.

30:48.790 --> 30:50.910
His Highness won't misunderstand you.

30:52.365 --> 30:53.430
I know.

30:55.590 --> 30:56.765
He wants to

30:57.465 --> 30:59.310
defend me against injustice.

31:02.440 --> 31:03.486
They're just empty words.

31:03.510 --> 31:04.550
Why should I believe you?

31:04.840 --> 31:06.590
I can swear to God.

31:09.565 --> 31:11.440
Can you compare to
such a powerful family

31:11.615 --> 31:12.710
as Lu in Jiangnan?

31:13.640 --> 31:14.640
Well...

31:15.315 --> 31:16.550
I can't.

31:16.940 --> 31:18.715
Then why did you pester Xu Zhihu?

31:19.390 --> 31:20.726
Though she's a widow,

31:20.750 --> 31:22.440
she is still a member of the Lu Family.

31:23.165 --> 31:25.150
Weren't you afraid
the rumors about you and her

31:25.390 --> 31:26.670
would offend the family?

31:28.115 --> 31:29.115
Well...

31:32.765 --> 31:35.750
Xu Zhihu is really beautiful.

31:36.090 --> 31:37.366
So I'm attracted to her.

31:37.390 --> 31:38.465
So

31:39.440 --> 31:41.430
You risked your future for her?

31:43.265 --> 31:44.630
Do you think I'll believe you?

31:48.590 --> 31:49.217
Well...

31:49.241 --> 31:50.761
You can't explain it clearly, can you?

31:53.040 --> 31:54.190
I think

31:55.665 --> 31:56.830
I'd better kill you.

31:57.315 --> 32:00.230
What's your feud with North Liang?

32:00.490 --> 32:02.270
You don't get to ask questions.

32:03.590 --> 32:04.670
There're some things

32:05.315 --> 32:07.070
I would never tell you

32:08.630 --> 32:10.040
without knowing your identity.

32:15.965 --> 32:17.350
It doesn't hurt to tell you.

32:23.940 --> 32:25.390
I'm the princess of Chu.

32:31.510 --> 32:33.190
The princess of West Chu?

32:42.190 --> 32:44.046
You want me to walk around

32:44.070 --> 32:45.515
being dressed like this?

32:46.940 --> 32:49.220
Do you still want to walk around?

32:51.615 --> 32:53.141
This is Mansion of Lu.

32:53.165 --> 32:55.090
You'd better hide in the room.

32:55.815 --> 32:57.350
You're overreacting.

32:57.590 --> 32:59.465
Better than you get yourself killed.

32:59.640 --> 33:00.607
Under my protection,

33:00.631 --> 33:02.230
she won't get killed.

33:03.115 --> 33:04.116
Thank you, sir.

33:04.140 --> 33:05.950
I can rest assured with your protection.

33:07.290 --> 33:09.790
Xu Fengnian asked me to protect you.

33:09.890 --> 33:11.765
You should thank him, girl.

33:12.470 --> 33:13.990
I would never thank him.

33:22.015 --> 33:23.110
Old man.

33:23.365 --> 33:24.365
Yes?

33:25.340 --> 33:26.950
Where's my Divine Token?

33:34.315 --> 33:36.326
I lent it to you.

33:36.350 --> 33:37.815
Have you lost it?

33:38.040 --> 33:39.320
Be quiet.

33:39.365 --> 33:40.441
Xu Fengnian

33:40.465 --> 33:41.590
borrowed it just now.

33:41.865 --> 33:42.846
He has no rights

33:42.870 --> 33:44.265
to borrow my dagger.

33:48.690 --> 33:50.465
Why did he borrow it?

33:53.965 --> 33:55.110
Do you recognize

33:55.865 --> 33:56.865
the dagger?

33:56.990 --> 33:59.230
The national dagger of West Chu,

33:59.490 --> 34:00.790
Divine Token.

34:01.265 --> 34:02.430
You know it.

34:06.490 --> 34:07.830
According to historical records,

34:08.115 --> 34:09.165
the dagger

34:09.640 --> 34:11.030
may exchange for twelve cities.

34:11.415 --> 34:13.430
I've heard of the precious dagger.

34:13.840 --> 34:15.815
Are you really the princess of Chu?

34:16.890 --> 34:18.630
Are you still alive?

34:20.040 --> 34:21.470
Do you wish me to die?

34:23.165 --> 34:24.310
I dare not.

34:29.090 --> 34:30.510
Now I got it.

34:30.965 --> 34:32.815
Xu Xiao conquered Chu.

34:33.140 --> 34:35.165
Of course you hate them.

34:35.865 --> 34:37.515
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

34:38.715 --> 34:41.390
I heard that Xu Fengnian
is about to arrive at Jiangnan.

34:41.690 --> 34:43.270
You showed up at this time.

34:43.340 --> 34:44.710
It makes me confused.

34:46.590 --> 34:48.190
I came to Jiangnan this time

34:49.740 --> 34:51.870
in order to kill Xu Fengnian.

34:54.840 --> 34:56.216
You're just extra points.

34:56.240 --> 34:56.765
I...

34:57.015 --> 34:58.366
I have the same goal as you.

34:58.390 --> 34:59.630
I'm against North Liang, too.

35:00.415 --> 35:01.470
Please wait a minute.

35:04.140 --> 35:06.319
(To Liu Liting)

35:12.240 --> 35:13.240
Look at this.

35:20.665 --> 35:22.391
(From Jin Lanting at Imperial Academy)

35:22.415 --> 35:23.415
Imperial Academy?

35:24.515 --> 35:25.515
Was it from the capital?

35:25.690 --> 35:26.840
A good friend of mine

35:27.230 --> 35:29.115
is a scholar of Imperial Academy.

35:29.515 --> 35:31.550
Was it his idea

35:33.040 --> 35:34.400
to besmirch Xu Zhihu's reputation?

35:36.015 --> 35:38.915
He said the court was always
wary of North Liang.

35:39.240 --> 35:41.166
After North Liang
united with Jiangnan by marriage,

35:41.190 --> 35:42.566
they became a sting in their heart.

35:42.590 --> 35:44.765
If I blacken Xu Zhihu's name,

35:45.030 --> 35:47.066
I may turn the Lu Family

35:47.090 --> 35:48.230
against North Liang.

35:48.415 --> 35:49.590
Though doing so

35:49.765 --> 35:50.870
may offend the Lu Family,

35:51.090 --> 35:53.270
in the end, I may be appreciated
by His Majesty.

35:53.540 --> 35:54.940
When I go to the capital next time,

35:55.065 --> 35:57.465
I'll get a limitless future.

35:57.690 --> 35:58.690
Therefore,

35:58.815 --> 36:00.950
it was a complete conspiracy.

36:01.490 --> 36:03.515
Pestering Xu Zhihu
was just a smoke bomb.

36:04.740 --> 36:06.510
Don't call it a conspiracy.

36:06.715 --> 36:09.646
As a scholar,
it's my duty to serve my country.

36:09.670 --> 36:10.765
Does she

36:11.465 --> 36:12.565
know about these?

36:13.230 --> 36:14.240
No, she doesn't.

36:18.365 --> 36:20.066
What did you say?

36:20.090 --> 36:21.726
Your wife happened to see you?

36:21.750 --> 36:22.990
It wasn't a coincidence.

36:24.515 --> 36:25.846
She specially went to look for me.

36:25.870 --> 36:26.870
It wasn't a coincidence?

36:27.165 --> 36:28.710
I have a message sent to my wife

36:28.990 --> 36:31.310
before she hurried to Baoguo Temple.

36:34.215 --> 36:36.830
Then you took advantage of
your wife's relative

36:37.190 --> 36:38.526
and let the concubine in the palace

36:38.550 --> 36:40.366
help you to publicize it,

36:40.390 --> 36:42.790
so His Majesty
would hear of your name.

36:44.015 --> 36:45.040
Liu Liting,

36:45.565 --> 36:47.606
how could you trick your own wife?

36:47.630 --> 36:49.150
I just followed the trend.

36:49.490 --> 36:51.430
Don't say that.

36:53.840 --> 36:54.840
Your Highness,

36:55.265 --> 36:56.915
do you believe me now?

36:56.990 --> 36:58.870
I have the same goal as you.

36:59.115 --> 37:00.865
We're both against North Liang.

37:01.090 --> 37:02.465
As for that,

37:03.515 --> 37:04.515
you're right.

37:06.765 --> 37:08.365
You're really vicious.

37:09.140 --> 37:11.490
Xu Zhihu is ruined by you.

37:11.915 --> 37:13.590
The Lu Family has strict rules.

37:13.865 --> 37:15.216
In my opinion,

37:15.240 --> 37:17.716
it's best if the Lu Family
exercise domestic discipline on her.

37:17.740 --> 37:19.590
She may be beaten to death.

37:20.765 --> 37:23.515
Unfortunately, Lu Baijie
has been protecting her.

37:23.940 --> 37:25.070
It doesn't matter now.

37:25.890 --> 37:27.415
We've got a chance.

37:27.540 --> 37:28.540
What chance?

37:28.665 --> 37:31.110
We should figure out
Xu Fengnian's schedule first.

37:31.365 --> 37:32.791
Because of the rumors,

37:32.815 --> 37:34.165
he would come to see me alone.

37:34.940 --> 37:37.190
Then you take the opportunity
to kill him.

37:37.640 --> 37:40.086
You can take revenge for your country.

37:40.110 --> 37:41.126
As for me,

37:41.150 --> 37:42.366
I can completely destroy

37:42.390 --> 37:44.790
the oath of alliance forged
by the Lu Family and North Liang.

37:44.840 --> 37:46.350
It satisfies both sides.

37:51.690 --> 37:52.940
You're brilliant.

37:54.090 --> 37:55.915
No wonder you're a scholar.

37:56.990 --> 37:58.565
Who wrote the letter?

38:00.065 --> 38:00.690
You...

38:01.040 --> 38:02.240
Who are you?

38:04.815 --> 38:05.830
Jin Lanting.

38:06.565 --> 38:07.565
I've never heard of him.

38:08.065 --> 38:09.870
There're many scholars
in Imperial Academy.

38:10.290 --> 38:11.890
It's normal that you didn't hear of him.

38:11.915 --> 38:13.710
I want to know who he works for.

38:13.815 --> 38:14.830
Zhang Julu,

38:15.115 --> 38:16.115
or someone else?

38:16.565 --> 38:17.590
It's hard to decide.

38:17.865 --> 38:20.190
He's got such devious means.

38:20.515 --> 38:22.750
We must investigate him carefully later.

38:23.715 --> 38:24.990
You did a great job just now,

38:25.165 --> 38:26.550
but there was a flaw.

38:27.590 --> 38:29.646
When he said he was under instructions
from the capital,

38:29.670 --> 38:31.510
you shouldn't
soften your stance so quickly.

38:31.740 --> 38:32.926
The people of Chu hate Xu Xiao,

38:32.950 --> 38:34.391
but they hate the royal family
even more.

38:34.415 --> 38:35.691
When he said his wife is related

38:35.715 --> 38:37.430
to a concubine in the palace,

38:37.715 --> 38:39.006
you should be tougher,

38:39.030 --> 38:40.515
which fitted your role better.

38:40.665 --> 38:41.846
I'm not

38:41.870 --> 38:43.070
as thoughtful as you.

38:43.415 --> 38:44.965
Who the hell are you?

38:47.890 --> 38:49.065
I'm Xu Fengnian.

38:49.440 --> 38:51.030
I heard you were going to kill me.

38:51.465 --> 38:52.590
It doesn't matter, though.

38:53.815 --> 38:55.806
But you've crossed my bottom line

38:55.830 --> 38:58.190
trying to kill my sister
through the hands of the Lu Family.

38:58.715 --> 39:01.246
You treat me with blades,
I'll return you with blades.

39:01.270 --> 39:02.365
Liu Liting,

39:03.390 --> 39:04.870
you've brought ruin

39:05.415 --> 39:07.110
upon yourself.

39:10.690 --> 39:12.065
Help!

39:20.440 --> 39:21.440
Your Highness.

39:21.740 --> 39:22.740
What about her?

39:24.215 --> 39:25.870
She slapped my sister once.

39:26.490 --> 39:28.115
My sister slapped her in return.

39:29.565 --> 39:32.030
We're even with her.

39:32.340 --> 39:33.470
Just let her go?

39:34.840 --> 39:35.891
Why don't we kill her?

39:35.915 --> 39:36.915
It's easy.

39:36.990 --> 39:38.365
Whatever we do,

39:38.740 --> 39:40.190
we shouldn't cross the bottom line.

39:45.265 --> 39:47.390
Where are they going to take Mr. Liu?

39:47.790 --> 39:49.565
What did he do?

39:51.065 --> 39:52.690
What about his family?

39:53.040 --> 39:54.641
We just tied them up.

39:54.665 --> 39:55.606
We didn't hurt them.

39:55.630 --> 39:56.630
Good.

39:59.790 --> 40:01.430
Why do you shut his mouth?

40:01.790 --> 40:02.790
Remove the gag.

40:04.165 --> 40:05.750
Help!

40:05.965 --> 40:08.966
The son of Lord of North Liang
is killing people!

40:08.990 --> 40:11.265
- Just scream.
- Xu Fengnian.

40:11.565 --> 40:13.750
Xu Fengnian dares to lynch people.

40:14.040 --> 40:16.206
Is there any law in the country?

40:16.230 --> 40:17.491
Is there any heavenly principle?

40:17.515 --> 40:18.515
He's right.

40:18.940 --> 40:21.486
I'm the son of Lord of North Liang, Xu Fengnian.

40:21.510 --> 40:22.240
Everyone,

40:22.415 --> 40:24.630
keep it in your mind.

40:24.840 --> 40:25.840
Xu Fengnian,

40:25.965 --> 40:27.090
you can't kill me.

40:27.590 --> 40:30.265
Of course, I can kill you
if you try to kill other people.

40:30.365 --> 40:32.150
It's the heavenly principle and justice.

40:32.465 --> 40:33.750
I know I've made a mistake.

40:34.865 --> 40:35.865
I'm willing to...

40:36.415 --> 40:38.740
I'm willing to work for you.

40:41.490 --> 40:43.870
You've lost your last bit of guts.

40:44.215 --> 40:45.215
Go.

40:45.240 --> 40:46.240
Get back to Yangcheng.

40:46.665 --> 40:47.665
Xu Fengnian!

40:48.990 --> 40:49.990
Xu Fengnian!

40:50.565 --> 40:51.991
- Xu Fengnian, let go of me!
- It may kill him.

40:52.015 --> 40:53.015
Xu Fengnian!

40:55.290 --> 40:57.590
Xu Fengnian!
You won't die a natural death.

40:57.965 --> 41:00.350
You just said
he was in danger in Reed Marshes.

41:01.040 --> 41:02.870
Now God of Sword isn't around him.

41:04.490 --> 41:05.846
He went to Jiangxin County

41:05.870 --> 41:07.326
on the spur of the moment.

41:07.350 --> 41:08.630
He won't be assassinated.

41:10.190 --> 41:12.215
I'm not just worried about him.

41:12.715 --> 41:14.350
With so many guards around him,

41:14.615 --> 41:16.086
he was still attacked.

41:16.110 --> 41:17.926
Huangman'er went to Mount Longhu alone.

41:17.950 --> 41:19.390
It must be more dangerous.

41:19.940 --> 41:22.350
With extraordinary power,
he can protect himself.

41:23.165 --> 41:24.950
He is just human after all.

41:26.390 --> 41:27.870
I thought in the first place

41:28.115 --> 41:29.870
as long as I married into the Lu Family,

41:30.490 --> 41:32.710
they would stay safely in North Liang.

41:34.315 --> 41:35.490
I didn't expect us

41:36.140 --> 41:37.950
to be far apart

41:39.340 --> 41:41.030
from each other in the end.

42:10.215 --> 42:10.927
Little buddy,

42:10.951 --> 42:12.311
may I ask if this is Mount Longhu?

42:13.115 --> 42:14.115
Yeah.

42:14.290 --> 42:16.710
Which direction should I take
going up the mountain?

42:17.665 --> 42:18.665
Thanks.

42:23.590 --> 42:24.630
What are you looking at?

42:25.965 --> 42:27.041
I'm waiting for the hawthorns.

42:27.065 --> 42:28.065
Hawthorns?

42:28.615 --> 42:29.790
When the hawthorns are ripe,

42:30.040 --> 42:31.315
I'll save them for my brother.

42:34.840 --> 42:36.110
Who is your brother?

42:38.715 --> 42:39.790
Do you know him?

42:40.965 --> 42:41.990
What's your family name?

42:42.615 --> 42:43.615
Xu.

42:44.165 --> 42:45.165
Oh.

42:46.415 --> 42:47.710
Are you Xu Longxiang?

42:48.290 --> 42:49.290
Yeah.

42:49.915 --> 42:51.015
What a coincidence.

42:54.515 --> 42:56.510
It probably is fate.

43:29.870 --> 43:32.590
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.365 --> 43:37.165
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.090 --> 43:42.010
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.090 --> 43:46.890
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.190 --> 43:51.090
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.790 --> 43:55.610
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.615 --> 44:00.370
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.390 --> 44:05.315
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.815 --> 44:08.546
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.570 --> 44:09.810
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.590 --> 44:14.450
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.265 --> 44:17.991
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.015 --> 44:19.450
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.940 --> 44:23.815
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.240 --> 44:25.591
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.615 --> 44:28.450
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.865 --> 44:31.346
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.370 --> 44:33.770
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.065 --> 44:36.091
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.115 --> 44:38.291
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.315 --> 44:42.530
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.890 --> 44:44.026
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.050 --> 44:47.090
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.265 --> 44:49.226
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.250 --> 44:51.970
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.530 --> 44:54.346
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.370 --> 44:56.866
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.890 --> 45:00.990
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
